{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲把熟悉生活的亲切感闯入、缺席突然变得可感、身体先出现惊悸、愿望无处安放和紧张持续累积连成了清楚的因果链，但“越具体认出曾经能那样生活”略带连续个人往事的预设，对198–205思绪为何停不下来、紧张如何持续变化也主要以“无处靠近”和“没有出口”概括。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙更具体地解释了安宁正在成为过去为何先触发身体警报、舞步或熟悉材料重新出现为何不能恢复内心秩序，以及继续加力为何只会带来消耗而不能换来把握，但较多H/M编号使论证依赖外部索引，并将198–205偏向“屏息等待”，弱化了听感记录中思绪翻转、停不下来的持续盘旋感。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙的优势不在篇幅，而在于更明确地串起安宁将失、身体先于念头警觉、熟悉感无法重新安顿内心、继续用力反而加深耗损与紧张的因果转折，同时保留了主题再现与生活记忆之间的解释空间；对持续盘旋感的弱化是局部损失，但不足以抵消其在身体反应和应对机制上的实质增量。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3a2a83d0-3b47-4789-9936-3f54d41a784d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135629018239Z", "elapsed_seconds": 143.266, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:58:52.290044+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "df2149a61d9743ed1db809af42da9e3a7077c5aa8669d856bf3ef09843c9f014", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144